# UX & Surfaces Doctrine

Kao interacts through progressive surfaces:

- terminal (root interface)
- TUI cockpit
- web / PWA dashboard
- mobile companion

Experience principles:

- calm
- clear
- adaptive
- non intrusive

Changing device must not change Kao identity.

---

## Sovereign operator entry doctrine

The operator must enter through Kao first.

Canonical order:

- `kao ...` = sovereign operator entry
- `kao operator ...` = governed operator surface layer
- delegated brain exploration may call KaoBox internally
- direct KaoBox brain usage remains expert/internal unless explicitly needed

This doctrine preserves:

- memory sovereignty in Kao
- delegated cognitive tooling in KaoBox
- a single mental entrypoint for the operator
- future compatibility with TUI / web / PWA / SSH / SDK surfaces
